%% Diagram: Checkpoint and Resume Workflow
%% ID: HARNESS-D22 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal; durable resume not implemented
flowchart TD
  running["Approved task in progress"] --> checkpoint["Save commit, branch, dirty paths, decisions, tests and next step"]
  checkpoint --> interrupt["Session interrupted or runtime stopped"]
  interrupt --> inspect["Re-read checkpoint and inspect actual workspace"]
  inspect --> compare{"Commit, files and constraints match?"}
  compare -->|No| reconcile["Reconcile changes or mark BLOCKED"]
  compare -->|Yes| context["Load scoped context and verified evidence"]
  context --> resume["Resume only remaining approved work"]
  resume --> checkpoint
